Description
-----------

The SHOW CREATE PACKAGE BODY statement can be used when Oracle SQL_MODE is
set. It shows the CREATE statement that creates the given package body (i.e.
the implementation).

SHOW CREATE PACKAGE BODY quotes identifiers according to the value of the
