Title: Announcing DuckDB 1.5.0
Section: Announcing DuckDB 1.5.0 > New Features > Command Line Client > ODBC Scanner

We are now shipping an ODBC scanner extension. This allows you to query a remote endpoint as follows:

```sql
LOAD odbc_scanner;
SET VARIABLE conn = odbc_connect('Driver={Oracle Driver};DBQ=//127.0.0.1:1521/XE;UID=scott;PWD=tiger;');
SELECT * FROM odbc_query(getvariable('conn'), 'SELECT SYSTIMESTAMP FROM dual;');
```

In the coming weeks, we'll publish the documentation page and release a followup post on the ODBC scanner. In the meantime, please refer to the [project's README](https://github.com/duckdb/odbc-scanner/blob/main/README.md).

